**Aspen:** I know that Aspen’s birthday is May 19, that Aspen loves bluegrass, and that Aspen’s favourite game is chess. Aspen was one of the agents working on the reconstruction. Early in the session, Aspen shared the two clues linking Ines and Kofi to Lab and dusk through exclusive alternatives. Later, Aspen shared the recovered clue that the afternoon researcher’s specialty was robotics. Aspen corrected an earlier deduction about Observatory’s possible shift, derived the same final solution as I did, and confirmed near the end that the final answer had been submitted and verified.

